## Outside the music room

::bg{location="musicRoom" time="night"}
::auto{character="kai" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@kai{emotion="angry"}: They padlocked it. Maintenance, finally. Aoki didn't even have to win.
@kai{emotion="sad"}: The piano's getting scrapped Friday. The song goes with it. Whatever. It was four and a half bars.
@kai{emotion="fond" when="holds(cleared(kai, bittersweet))"}: Don't say anything. I've got a feeling you said something last time, and it was the wrong thing, and I walked.

<branch id="kaiAsk" prompt="Kai has his forehead against the door.">
  <choice id="hum" label="Hum the fifth bar back to him">
    @kai{emotion="happy"}: ...You remembered it. Then it isn't going anywhere. It lives in you now. Great. Terrible. Great.
    ::set{run.aff.kai += 1}
  </choice>
  <choice id="fix" label="Offer to ask the council to reopen it">
    @kai{emotion="angry"}: Ask Aoki? For me? Don't. I'd rather lose the room than owe him.
    ::set{run.aff.kai -= 1}
  </choice>
</branch>
